=== A) tool 角色是否被接受 ===
content：'{"name": "read_file", "arguments": {"path": "notes.txt"}}'  finish_reason=stop  usage={'prompt_tokens': 104, 'completion_tokens': 18, 'total_tokens': 122}

=== B) 把工具结果改写成 user 角色再说一遍 ===
content：'{"name": "read_file", "arguments": {"path": "notes.txt"}}'  finish_reason=stop  usage={'prompt_tokens': 118, 'completion_tokens': 18, 'total_tokens': 136}

=== C) 历史变长时 prompt_tokens（工具结果按 user 角色回填）===
额外 0 组「调用+结果」：prompt_tokens = 67
额外 1 组「调用+结果」：prompt_tokens = 117
额外 2 组「调用+结果」：prompt_tokens = 167
额外 4 组「调用+结果」：prompt_tokens = 267
额外 8 组「调用+结果」：prompt_tokens = 467

=== D) 错误回灌（用 user 角色回填错误）===
